The wrapper already compiles to a single trivial template instantiation, so there is no redundant work to remove; any manual reimplementation of the union access would risk a behavioral difference. I kept the exact `GetValue<FIT_UINT8>` call, which is the fastest correct form available from this translation unit.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 FieldBase::GetUINT8Value(const FIT_UINT8 fieldArrayIndex) const
{
    return GetValue<FIT_UINT8>(fieldArrayIndex);
}
```